==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ten-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|sustenaunce}}, from {{der|en|fro|sustenance}}, from {{m|fro|sustenir}} with the suffix {{m|fr|-ance}}, from {{der|en|VL.|*sustenire}}, from {{der|en|la|sustinere}}. Compare also {{cog|LL.|sustinentia}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsʌs.tə.nəns/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-sustenance.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# Something that provides [[support]] or [[nourishment]].
